  "description": "In the icy lands of the North, the duke battles nightly with an uncontrollable desire that consumes him. Seeking respite, he meets a mysterious wizard who proposes a pact: to quell his urges, the duke must give up his essence for the wizard's research. But just how far are these two willing to go to help one another? \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
